00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:21.770
And humans and <i>yokai</i> have
entirely different lifespans.

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:24.270
I want to make you happy.

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:27.150
We should break up.

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:33.740
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.700
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:40.410
