<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:16.820
H-Hello there!

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:23.770
I see you here all the time.
Aren't you cold?

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:29.240
Here. You can wear this!

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:36.340
U-Um! I've been interested in you
for a long time!

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:38.340
Please read this!

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:52.850
I am sorry, but can you still say that
after seeing this?

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:01.700
A-A Yuki-Onna?!

00:03:04.720 --> 00:03:05.730
CHAPTER 39

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:10.710
YUKI-ONNA PURE WHITE LOVE REPORT

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:13.080
What?!

00:03:13.310 --> 00:03:16.090
Is it true? A human boyfriend?

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:17.050
Yes.

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:19.310
Um, Yuki-san, was it?

00:03:19.310 --> 00:03:20.090
Yes?

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:23.550
Does he know that you're a <i>yokai</i>?

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:26.630
I told him so at the very beginning.

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:31.850
E-Even so! I still love you!

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:33.100
I love you!

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:36.600
I love you!!

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:41.360
He was so insistent that I gave in.

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:43.810
Huh.

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:49.250
Love between a <i>yokai</i> and a human
sounds so romantic!

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:51.080
You're a lucky girl.

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:54.080
Do you really think so?

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:54.880
Huh?

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:57.090
Yuki!

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:59.340
Hey, Yuki!

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:03.130
I missed you! Yuki!

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:04.760
Is that him?

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:06.260
Yuki!

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:09.110
H-He seems intense.

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:10.360
I know.

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:12.770
Forgive me. I should go.

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:16.530
I promised that I would
cook for him today.

00:04:16.530 --> 00:04:17.640
Excuse me.

00:04:20.010 --> 00:04:23.410
I guess Yuki seems pretty happy after all.

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:24.900
That's a relief.

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:30.580
Did you want more time with your friends?

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:31.690
What?

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:35.740
I know I tend to be
a little pushy sometimes.

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:38.090
Tell me if it ever bothers you.

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:43.470
It is fine. We were almost done anyways.

00:04:43.740 --> 00:04:45.210
That's a relief!

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:51.560
Your hand is cold, Yuki.

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:54.090
If you do not like it, let go.

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:56.060
Nah.

00:04:56.710 --> 00:04:58.010
I love it...

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:00.070
so much.

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:10.700
I'm so lucky!

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:17.490
Here.

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:21.390
I added strawberry milk
and seasonal pond smelts.

00:05:21.390 --> 00:05:22.180
What?

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:23.600
N-Nothing!

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:25.580
Looks delicious!

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:32.440
Is it unpleasant?

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:34.210
O-Of course not!

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:42.740
Man that was great! Mind if I take a bath?

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:43.700
Go ahead.

00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:45.060
Thanks!

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:58.540
Man, I didn't expect
a fish snow cone for dinner in midwinter.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:00.930
It's gonna affect my health at this rate.

00:06:00.930 --> 00:06:03.100
Plus the room's kind of chilly.

00:06:03.100 --> 00:06:05.910
I guess we have different tastes.

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:13.440
I am sorry to make you cold.

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:16.020
It must be a burden to be with me.

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:17.890
Y-Y-Y-Y-Yuki!

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:21.900
Maybe you would be better off
dating a human girl.

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:24.390
Wait a minute, Yuki...!

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:27.890
Yuki!

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:31.070
And you just walked out?!

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:32.320
Yes.

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:34.700
But you like him, don't you?

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:36.200
I do not know.

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:37.200
Huh?

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:41.290
I do not really understand
how it feels to love someone.

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:44.200
What does it mean to be in love?

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:46.970
W-Well...

00:06:46.970 --> 00:06:49.930
You find you're thinking about him
all the time.

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:54.510
When you see him, you get nervous
and act cold and regret it later...

00:06:55.700 --> 00:06:56.850
Regardless!

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:59.440
You can't just fight and break up!

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:03.780
Why don't you talk with him
about why you fought?

00:07:03.780 --> 00:07:09.120
I read in a manga that the most important
thing to romance is being honest.

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:10.030
That's right.

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:18.340
As the rate of lifelong singles increases,
it's no longer just a human issue.

00:07:18.340 --> 00:07:20.260
<i>Yokai</i> want relationships, too!

00:07:20.260 --> 00:07:25.710
That's why I started BiBiBit Matching
to support human-<i>yokai</i> romances.

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:25.610
100% SUCCESS!
LOVE ADVISOR

00:07:26.360 --> 00:07:30.220
Please tell me
how I can get Yuki to forgive me!

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:34.420
I understand. Leave everything to me.

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:37.940
First, sign this contract here.

00:07:37.940 --> 00:07:38.980
Okay.

00:07:38.980 --> 00:07:40.680
What is this?

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:44.940
You told me a human was
having problems with a <i>yokai</i>.

00:07:45.340 --> 00:07:47.890
He is. Love problems.

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:50.070
You're my bodyguard.

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:51.330
Are you joking?

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:53.910
You think you can solve love problems?

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:55.910
<i>Doki Doki Paradise!</i>

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:55.800
ADOLESCENT ACADEMY
DOKI DOKI PARADISE

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:57.080
What is this?

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:59.910
Use that to learn a little bit about love.

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:02.670
So, how can I make up with Yuki?

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:06.750
My dear sir, there is one thing that
no <i>yokai</i> can resist.

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:10.060
<i>Hey! You ran into me
and now you're ignoring me?</i>

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:11.030
LUV AIDE

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:11.130
<i>Who are you?</i>

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:14.390
Kitaro.

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:20.520
I always thought you were too thick
when it came to this sort of thing.

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:23.520
Let me teach you about
this thing called love.

00:08:25.210 --> 00:08:26.030
Kitaro!

00:08:26.030 --> 00:08:27.520
Oh, right.

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:30.650
Yuki, thanks for seeing me today.

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:33.500
I really regret what I said!

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:35.580
This is to apologize to you.

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:38.200
I hope you'll accept my feelings!

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:39.530
Here you go!

00:08:40.220 --> 00:08:42.210
Moldy raisin bread!

00:08:42.210 --> 00:08:44.880
H-Huh? You don't like it?

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:46.830
Then how about this?!

00:08:47.440 --> 00:08:48.590
A rotting melon!

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:55.180
Th-That's strange. I thought this was
supposed to work on any <i>yokai</i>.

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:55.930
Seriously?

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.640
Only Rat Man eats that sort of stuff.

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:00.560
Let me be perfectly blunt.

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:03.590
Your taste is honestly the worst.

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:05.690
And you are inconsiderate.

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:10.370
If you paid any attention you would
have at least brought some frozen yogurt.

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:13.650
No, using gifts to buy forgiveness
in itself is shortsighted.

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:16.780
Plus your hands are always sweaty
and you are too emotional.

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:19.620
That's not what we meant by being honest!

00:09:19.890 --> 00:09:23.090
Your only option now is
to fix it with money.

00:09:23.090 --> 00:09:25.160
-Rat Man!
-Gulp!

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:27.210
This was your idea, wasn't it?!

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:28.420
I was just...

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:30.170
Save it for the judge!

00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:35.420
<i>Honestly, you boys!</i>

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:39.300
<i>I'm preparing for the school festival.
Get out of the way!</i>

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:42.080
SORRY / SHUT UP / I'LL HELP

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:42.180
Hmm. A choice.

00:09:42.870 --> 00:09:44.780
Should I choose "Sorry" here?

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:46.070
No, wait!

00:09:46.070 --> 00:09:49.770
You should show sincerity to women
through actions not words.

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:51.730
In that case...

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:53.890
I'LL HELP

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:55.740
<i>Th-Thank you!</i>

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:57.440
See? I was right!

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:03.380
Ow, ow, ow. That stupid Catchick.

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:04.690
Hello?

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:10.250
Are you Rat Man-san?
From BiBiBit Matching?

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:12.780
Yes, yes, I am indeed!

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:19.640
I cannot believe Shun-san
would bring such things.

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:21.850
I have returned.

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:23.890
I heard, Yuki.

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:25.390
Mother.

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:30.050
Is it true you are dating a human man?

00:10:30.420 --> 00:10:33.740
Human men are
worthless and foolish creatures.

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:35.900
They only bring you pain!

00:10:36.170 --> 00:10:38.030
Worthless and foolish...

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:47.800
Besides, we can only be in
the human realm during the winter.

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:51.970
And humans and <i>yokai</i> have
entirely different lifespans.

00:10:51.970 --> 00:10:54.510
We can never understand each other.

00:10:54.510 --> 00:10:56.050
Do you understand?

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:57.290
Yes.

00:10:58.150 --> 00:10:59.430
But Father...

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:01.750
Do you understand?!

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:03.430
Yes.

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:08.480
I hurt Yuki again.

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:10.690
I thought you might be here.

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:13.480
Yuki! Were you looking for me?!

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:14.940
I'm touched!

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:17.190
We should break up.

00:11:19.090 --> 00:11:20.870
Wh-Why, Yuki?!

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:24.190
I apologize for earlier. I'm sorry!

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:28.410
But believe me. My love is true!

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:31.970
I can only be in the human realm
during the winter.

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:34.790
And our lifespans are entirely different.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:38.550
I don't care!
Our love can overcome any obstacle!

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:45.630
That may not have existed
in the first place.

00:11:47.490 --> 00:11:48.880
I...

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:52.900
I have never felt certainty
in any love for you.

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:56.230
I merely dated you because you insisted.

00:11:56.630 --> 00:11:57.970
But...

00:11:58.590 --> 00:11:59.740
Then...

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:05.240
I was the only one who thought
we loved each other?

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:06.980
Goodbye.

00:12:16.610 --> 00:12:17.830
Yuki!

00:12:23.780 --> 00:12:25.770
What a cold broad!

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:29.350
Man, breaking up with her
was the right idea.

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:31.970
More importantly...

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:42.360
You broke up?! Seriously?

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:46.740
It would never have worked out
between a <i>yokai</i> and a human...

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:56.380
W-Well, influenced by Rat Man or not,
bringing that stuff was pretty stupid.

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:57.460
Stupid...

00:12:59.610 --> 00:13:01.180
That is a little harsh.

00:13:01.180 --> 00:13:03.880
He is naive and does not question anyone.

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:06.230
That's called being stupid.

00:13:06.230 --> 00:13:08.260
You were right to dump him.

00:13:09.990 --> 00:13:12.320
I thought that was a bit much, too.

00:13:12.320 --> 00:13:13.180
Right?

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:18.390
That is what is good about him!
His simplicity lets him accept anything...

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:31.120
Yuki!

00:13:31.390 --> 00:13:34.440
Oh, Shun, what is it?

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:42.670
YUKI-ONNA

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:47.180
BOWL BATH

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:46.070
-<i>"Scratch, scratch."</i>
-<i>"Ge."</i>

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:47.070
<i>"Shake, shake."</i>

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:48.180
Yuki!

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:52.470
Yuki!

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:58.280
You've got the wrong idea, Yuki!
Rat Man-san begged me to...

00:13:58.280 --> 00:13:59.360
Don't go!

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:00.450
Please!

00:14:00.450 --> 00:14:04.230
I'm sorry. She's the only one for me!

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:13.540
Yuki!

00:14:19.810 --> 00:14:23.850
I never really understood
what I was feeling.

00:14:23.850 --> 00:14:26.300
But, I finally understand now.

00:14:28.070 --> 00:14:31.050
I hate that man!

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:33.060
Yuki...

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:38.360
When I saw him, my chest hurt
like something was grabbing it.

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:40.400
I could not stand it.

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:41.940
I have never felt this!

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:44.440
I have never hated someone so much!

00:14:46.170 --> 00:14:49.580
Yuki! Where are you?!

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:52.530
Yuki! Where are you, Yuki?!

00:14:52.930 --> 00:14:54.540
-Shun.
-Yuki!

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:58.660
How cold. After I was finally
introduced to a human.

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:02.540
I was going to bring you home
and take my time eating you!

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:03.780
Eat me?!

00:15:11.280 --> 00:15:14.230
<i>Why are you so nice to me all the time?</i>

00:15:14.230 --> 00:15:16.230
<i>Are you saying that...</i>

00:15:16.230 --> 00:15:17.430
I LOVE YOU / I HATE YOU / LET'S BE FRIENDS

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:19.570
This is the moment of truth!

00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:21.510
Yes, Dad.

00:15:23.710 --> 00:15:25.570
What? Shun-san is...?!

00:15:29.090 --> 00:15:31.990
Yuki, that pain in your chest...

00:15:35.850 --> 00:15:37.160
is jealousy.

00:15:37.810 --> 00:15:39.160
Jealousy?

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:42.540
You feel that way
because you love Shun-san, right?

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:45.890
I do not know such an emotion as jealousy!

00:15:45.890 --> 00:15:47.100
This is not that!

00:15:47.100 --> 00:15:48.460
A monster!

00:15:50.070 --> 00:15:51.470
What's wrong?!

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:52.980
It's a monster!

00:15:52.980 --> 00:15:54.900
You should get out of here!

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:57.400
It got some intense guy over there!

00:15:57.400 --> 00:15:58.350
Could it be...?!

00:15:58.350 --> 00:15:59.730
Shun-san!

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:05.190
Yuki...

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:10.320
Do you really want Shun-san
to be killed by a <i>yokai</i>?

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:11.560
I...

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:13.820
I...

00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:20.440
I have not told him how I feel yet!

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:27.800
So, how should I eat you?

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:29.340
Shun-san!

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:34.800
Yuki!

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:37.100
What are you doing here?! Run!

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:40.060
Yuki-Onna! Are you after my prey?!

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:44.140
You idiot! Get out of here!

00:16:45.670 --> 00:16:48.110
We're not together any--

00:16:56.680 --> 00:16:58.370
I hate, hate, hate it!

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:04.670
I hate how you blurt out everything!
I hate how simple and intense you are!

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:07.410
I hate how different you are from me!

00:17:07.810 --> 00:17:11.340
Y-You're saying that now?!
Are you even paying attention?!

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:13.720
I also hate how loud you are!

00:17:15.280 --> 00:17:17.770
Well then I've got
a few things to say, too!

00:17:17.770 --> 00:17:23.010
I hate how I can't tell
what you're thinking or how blunt you are!

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:27.480
Do you know how hard it was
to hear you say you never loved me?

00:17:30.670 --> 00:17:31.720
But...

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:34.870
Even so, I love you!

00:17:34.870 --> 00:17:36.910
I can't help what I feel!

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:42.210
Do you really understand?

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:44.530
We are a human and a <i>yokai</i>.

00:17:44.890 --> 00:17:47.710
It will only burden you with more pain.

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:51.640
I already told you!
Our love can overcome anything!

00:17:51.640 --> 00:17:52.900
And you?

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:55.010
Is your answer still the same?!

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:57.420
I...

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:01.770
I feel the same way you do.

00:18:01.770 --> 00:18:04.210
I hate you, Shun-san, but...

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:07.350
I love you even more!

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:08.720
Yuki!

00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:12.230
Knock off that flirting!

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:13.390
Shun-san!

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:22.290
Little girl, you think you can fight me?

00:18:22.290 --> 00:18:23.790
Stop.

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:27.410
Let go of that man.

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:29.420
Kitaro!

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:31.910
And if I say no?

00:18:33.070 --> 00:18:34.630
Remote Controlled Geta...

00:18:40.240 --> 00:18:44.050
H-Hey, Kitaro! Get a grip!

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:50.100
I'm sorry. I was up all night
playing that game, so I'm sleepy.

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:51.860
Kitaro?

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:53.230
Who are you?

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:58.770
WHO ARE YOU?

00:18:58.770 --> 00:19:01.620
IGNORE / APOLOGIZE / INTRODUCE

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:03.570
I'm Kitaro.

00:19:03.930 --> 00:19:05.370
What's your name?

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:07.120
I'm Numa-Gozen.

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:09.120
Numa-Gozen...

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:11.880
WHAT A WEIRD NAME / I SEE /
WHAT A PRETTY NAME

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:14.250
What a pretty name.

00:19:14.530 --> 00:19:15.490
Huh?

00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:18.220
Kitaro?

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:22.430
Trying to butter me up? You won't stop me!

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:24.890
SORRY / SHUT UP / I'LL HELP

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:29.650
I can't let you do
what you're trying to do.

00:19:29.650 --> 00:19:34.280
But, other than that,
I'll do anything I can to help you.

00:19:34.280 --> 00:19:36.610
I want to make you happy.

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:37.850
Huh?!

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:42.370
There's something different about him...

00:19:42.370 --> 00:19:45.990
You're kidding...
Kitaro likes Numa-Gozen?!

00:19:47.890 --> 00:19:51.870
<i>What is this fluttering
I haven't felt in three centuries?</i>

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:55.080
Finger G...

00:20:00.360 --> 00:20:02.330
Finger G...

00:20:05.490 --> 00:20:06.510
Finger...

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:10.590
Fi...

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:13.600
Bang.

00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:28.490
I've been shot through the heart...

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:32.200
Yuki!

00:20:33.560 --> 00:20:35.720
Shun-san! Are you all right?!

00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:36.640
Yeah!

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:37.840
Thank goodness.

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:41.910
Kitaro...

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:46.810
Thank you so much!

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:50.560
I'm glad you made up. Don't fight anymore.

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:54.690
No. We intend to fight a lot more
from now on.

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:55.730
What?

00:20:56.250 --> 00:21:00.200
There are many hurdles
that we have to overcome.

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:05.740
But we have decided to fight while
we find our own way to live together.

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:08.530
I'm never letting you go, Yuki!

00:21:08.850 --> 00:21:11.250
I love you, Yuki!

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:12.860
How embarrassing.

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:17.120
Oh dear.

00:21:17.810 --> 00:21:22.130
It looks like those two
will repeat the cycle again.

00:21:22.570 --> 00:21:24.750
Just like we did.

00:21:27.570 --> 00:21:30.680
I didn't know Kitaro had been
playing some weird game.

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:33.680
Well, I figured as much.

00:21:33.680 --> 00:21:37.070
I guess it was
a good learning experience, wasn't it?

00:21:37.070 --> 00:21:43.060
I'm sorry, Dad. I guess I just
don't understand that sort of thing.

00:21:45.380 --> 00:21:48.540
How can I make Kitaro be mine?

00:21:48.540 --> 00:21:49.740
Wh-What?!

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:54.120
I'm not releasing you
until I have Kitaro's heart.

00:21:54.690 --> 00:21:55.670
Ow!

00:21:55.670 --> 00:21:59.450
G-G-G-Gimme a break!

